+Subject: [PATCH] replace removed kernel strncpy calls
+
+Use the kernel string API available with Linux 7.3 while preserving string
+termination, fixed-field padding and explicitly sized Lua script copies.
+Validate userspace copy lengths before accessing the fixed-size fields.
+Userspace calls continue to use libc unchanged.
+
